 "about": {
  "heading": "What's a plan mule?",
  "paragraphs": [
   "A plan mule is a character made just to hold every plan in the game, so you can check which ones you're missing.",
   "The mule isn't for trading. Meet up with it, open the trade window and scroll to the bottom: the game lists every plan your character doesn't know. Take a quick screenshot so you've got your missing list for later."
  ]
 },
